{"availability":"available","full":"lightorigins/Light-O1","name":"Light-O1","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":168,"forks":7,"created":"2026-09-20T15:31:19Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:39:22Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/LightOriginsHQ/Light-O1-Preview-playground","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:17.668Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:17.668Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:17.668Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:17.668Z","stars":168,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Light-O1-Preview turns an instruction into whole-body humanoid action. It is pretrained on structured human action recovered from internet video, which gives it a transferable action prior, and then post-trained on purpose-collected data to adapt that prior to a target embodiment and to human intent.","Given a prompt, the model answers in two parts: it states in language what the instruction requires of the body, then generates the action. The plan is readable, so you can see what the model understood before it moved. Actions come out as a (frames, 138) unified human action representation at 20 FPS, which renders a character directly or drives a behavior foundation model on a robot.","Light-O1-Preview releases the text-to-action capability only. We are working towards the full Light-O1, which will add vision and manipulation. Stay tuned — thanks for your interest!"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lightorigins/Light-O1/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"779bb4c9260a220eb3a76eec8891743389a6269c7c1e8453c4f5674640e6012e","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.002Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:18.002Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Light-O1-Preview turns an instruction into whole-body humanoid action. It is pretrained on